---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How the M.M. Construction & Consults website sends, stores and protects the details you share through the enquiry form, WhatsApp and external services.">
<PageHero label="Privacy policy" title="Your enquiry. Your choice." text="How information is handled when you use this website or contact our team."/>
<section class="section"><div class="container legal"><p>This policy describes how the M.M. Construction &amp; Consults website handles the information you send us. Last updated: October 2026.</p><h2>Information you choose to share</h2><p>The enquiry form asks for your name, email address, phone number, the service you need, an optional project location and a message. We use these details only to reply to your enquiry and discuss your project. You confirm this by ticking the consent box before sending.</p><h2>How the enquiry form sends your details</h2><p>When you press Send Enquiry, your details are sent securely (HTTPS) to a small server function run by our website host, Netlify. The function checks the form and emails it to our own company mailbox ({site.email}), sent through our own email provider. No other email-forwarding service is involved, and the website does not keep your enquiry in a database.</p><p>The email also records which page you sent the form from and the time it was sent, so we can follow up correctly.</p><h2>Where your enquiry is stored, and for how long</h2><p>Your enquiry is stored as an email in our company mailbox, hosted by our email provider (Hostinger). We keep enquiry emails only as long as needed to respond, prepare a quotation and keep normal business records. To ask us to delete your enquiry, contact us using the details below.</p><h2>Spam protection</h2><p>To stop automated spam, the server function limits how many enquiries can be sent from one internet connection in a short period. For this it stores a one-way, scrambled code (a hash) of your IP address with the time of the attempt; the IP address itself is not stored. The website host may also keep standard technical logs, such as IP addresses and browser details, while serving the website.</p><h2>Browser storage</h2><p>While you fill in the form, a copy of what you type is kept in your own browser for this tab only (session storage), so nothing is lost if the connection fails or you go back a page. It is removed when the enquiry is sent or when you close the tab, and it is never sent anywhere except with your enquiry.</p><h2>WhatsApp enquiries</h2><p>If you choose Send via WhatsApp instead, the form creates a WhatsApp link containing the information you entered and opens WhatsApp. You choose whether to send that message.</p><p>Your enquiry information is passed to WhatsApp through the link when you open it. WhatsApp processes information under its own privacy terms. Share only the details needed for an initial project conversation; avoid sensitive personal documents.</p><h2>Analytics and advertising</h2><p>This website does not use analytics scripts, advertising trackers or cookies.</p><h2>Embedded map</h2><p>The contact page embeds a Google Maps view of our office location. When it loads, Google may receive technical information from your browser under its own privacy terms.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>Instagram, Facebook, and WhatsApp links take you to services operated by other providers. Their privacy practices and terms apply when you use them.</p><h2>Questions about an enquiry</h2><p>If you need to discuss information you shared with the company, please contact the team on <a class="text-link" href={site.phones[0].href}>{site.phones[0].label}</a> or email <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p></div></section>
</Layout>
